WEBVTT

00:01:28.238 --> 00:01:31.317
In your living room,
in full imaginative broadband,

00:01:31.341 --> 00:01:33.619
picture Britney Spears.

00:01:34.373 --> 00:01:39.472
She is scantily clad, she's dancing
on your coffee table,

00:01:39.496 --> 00:01:41.785
and she's singing
"Hit Me Baby One More Time."

00:01:42.361 --> 00:01:44.707
And then, follow me into your kitchen.

00:01:45.091 --> 00:01:49.361
In your kitchen, the floor has been
paved over with a yellow brick road,

00:01:49.385 --> 00:01:54.768
and out of your oven are coming
towards you Dorothy, the Tin Man,

00:01:54.792 --> 00:01:57.713
the Scarecrow and the Lion
from "The Wizard of Oz,"

00:01:57.737 --> 00:01:59.976
hand-in-hand, skipping
straight towards you.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.546
Okay. Open your eyes.